WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.125
To sum up.

2
00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:04.493
You projected an audit run onto
the five closure conditions,

3
00:00:04.493 --> 00:00:07.706
saw which fields wait on
evidence from outside the audit,

4
00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:11.124
saw what the exception registry
and the Arc snapshot change,

5
00:00:11.124 --> 00:00:14.200
and compared two runs so a
regression became a finding.

6
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.936
Closure is the record that keeps
coming back clean on a schedule,

7
00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:19.487
and each drift row is a task.

8
00:00:19.487 --> 00:00:22.563
Before shipping, work through
the Chapter 9 checklist.

9
00:00:22.563 --> 00:00:26.180
Next, Module 10: deploying
to test and production.
